# minicom settings for the GECKO5Education UART (FT2232H channel B), used by 'make console'.
# 115200 8N1 matches the firmware examples (divisor 27 at 50 MHz); the board has no RTS/CTS wiring,
# so hardware flow control is off. The device comes from 'make console' (-D), not from here.
pu baudrate         115200
pu bits             8
pu parity           N
pu stopbits         1
pu rtscts           No
pu xonxoff          No
pu minit
pu mreset
pu mhangup
